cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Which-instrument TPB replication package (Paper 1B)"
message: "If you use this code or gold-standard file, please cite the article and this release."
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/occbuu/which-instrument-tpb"
abstract: >
  Replication package for Paper 1B: human-anchored adjudication of dictionary,
  encoder, NLI and zero-shot LLM measures of the same text constructs. Includes
  analysis code, manuscript tables, de-identified error excerpts, and a
  text-free gold frame (N = 532) with salted document IDs.
keywords:
  - construct validity
  - dictionary methods
  - zero-shot classification
  - inter-coder reliability
  - online reviews
authors:
  - family-names: "Le Ngoc"
    given-names: "Hieu"
    email: lnhieu@ptit.edu.vn
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1133-1433"
    affiliation: "Faculty of Information Technology 2, Posts and Telecommunications Institute of Technology, Ho Chi Minh City Campus, Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam"
